range residents of the mall. Help them with their problems or just listen to their tales. Find joy and hope, even in this awful world.</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Help an alien repair her ship</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Date a will o' wisp</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fight a cockroach in a wrestling match</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Find Findley</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Host a movie night</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Investigate a numbers station with Mothman</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Meet Diane (if you're lucky)</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Compete in a game show hosted by<i> The Clown</i></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >And More</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>UNCOVER THE TRUTH</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3910160/extras/54483ce9a19a07681d6e0c14b289401a.poster.avif?t=1761967266\" width=1600 height=812 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3910160/extras/54483ce9a19a07681d6e0c14b289401a.webm?t=1761967266\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3910160/extras/54483ce9a19a07681d6e0c14b289401a.mp4?t=1761967266\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Learn about the secrets of this warped world and the conspiracy of the Mall's existence. Find the secrets hidden within its walls and try desperately to hold on to your sanity.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>A NEON DRENCHED PRISON</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3910160/extras/f205ce0b43e1bd3d45f1ebbe75145130.poster.avif?t=1761967266\" width=1600 height=812 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3910160/extras/f205ce0b43e1bd3d45f1ebbe75145130.webm?t=1761967266\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3910160/extras/f205ce0b43e1bd3d45f1ebbe75145130.mp4?t=1761967266\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore a sunless world  rendered in an atmospheric, dreamlike, &quot;neon-chalkpunk&quot; style set to the tune of a massive genre-bending soundtrack.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>LIVE TO TELL THE TALE</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3910160/extras/826c103e3ce7fbd9aaad612ae2a78209.avif?t=1761967266\" width=1600 height=812 /></span><strong></strong><br><br>Experience a dark, yet heartfelt story full of twists, turns, and memorable characters. Persevere despite it all.</p>",
